Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:54.50,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}旬を過ぎチカラのように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:57.51,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}Rotten to the core deeper また一つ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:01.74,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}でも I have reawakened for revenge
